| Process | Existing (manual) system | Problem | eSmartLib solution |
|---|---|---|---|
| Borrowing/returning | Manual input to the system | Slow, error-prone, no overdue tracking | QR scan, automatic due date, availability count |
| Attendance | Paper log book (manual) | Hard to summarize | QR time-in/time-out + history |
| Book availability | Checked in person at the library only | Students cannot check/reserve online | Online book requests |
| Reports | Compiled manually from records | Time-consuming | Dashboard + history filters |
| Account/password help | N/A | No self-service or recovery process | Admin-issued reset code |
